It works across any app, letting users speak naturally to dictate, edit, and write text instantly. Whether writing an email, revising a document, or grasping complex information, VoiceOS transforms voice into the most powerful productivity tool, bridging the gap between thought and expression.</div></div></div></div><div class="relative isolate z-0"><div class="mx-auto max-w-ycdc-page px-4"><div class="my-4 text-2xl font-bold text-[#333333] md:mt-0">Active Founders</div><div class="max-w-[800px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-y-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-b-0"><div class="w-full"><div class="ycdc-card-new group relative w-full space-y-1.5 w-full"><div class="hidden gap-4 md:flex"><div class="aspect-square h-20 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl"><img src="https://bookface-images.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/avatars/90727c28d0b9a90a83ccf08a174fe5b25270d371.jpg?X-Amz-Algorithm=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-Credential=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-Date=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-Expires=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-Signature=REDACTED" class="h-full w-full object-cover" alt="Jonah Daian"/></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-x-2"><div class="text-xl font-bold">Jonah Daian</div><div class="flex gap-x-1 flex"><a href="https://x.com/jonah_daian" class="white flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-md hover:bg-gray-200" data-tooltip-id="founder-social-tooltip-1521900" data-tooltip-content="X" aria-label="Twitter account" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img src="/images/social/x-logo.svg" alt="Twitter account" class="h-4 w-4"/></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jonah-daian" class="white flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-md hover:bg-gray-200" data-tooltip-id="founder-social-tooltip-1521900" data-tooltip-content="LinkedIn" aria-label="LinkedIn profile" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><div class="inline-block h-4 w-4 bg-contain bg-image-link