iv></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-b-0"><div class="w-full"><div class="ycdc-card-new group relative w-full space-y-1.5 w-full"><div class="hidden gap-4 md:flex"><div class="aspect-square h-20 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl"><img src="https://bookface-images.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/avatars/6d29997e5dca07682a88b7572c8bb04f300144ae.jpg?X-Amz-Algorithm=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-Credential=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-Date=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-Expires=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=REDACTED&amp;X-Amz-Signature=REDACTED" class="h-full w-full object-cover" alt="Kai Brokering"/></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-x-2"><div class="text-xl font-bold">Kai Brokering</div><div class="flex gap-x-1 flex"><a href="https://x.com/kai_brokering" class="white flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-md hover:bg-gray-200" data-tooltip-id="founder-social-tooltip-1532285" data-tooltip-content="X" aria-label="Twitter account" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img src="/images/social/x-logo.svg" alt="Twitter account" class="h-4 w-4"/></a><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/francis-brokering" class="white flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-md hover:bg-gray-200" data-tooltip-id="founder-social-tooltip-1532285" data-tooltip-content="LinkedIn" aria-label="LinkedIn profile" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><div class="inline-block h-4 w-4 bg-contain bg-image-linkedin"> </div></a></div></div><div class="text-gray-600">Founder</div><div class="prose max-w-none"><div class="prose max-w-full whitespace-pre-line">Born in Tokyo moved to the U.S. at 15 to dive into the tech scene. Building cool stuff in the voice AI space.</div></div></div></div><div class="group space-y-3 md:hidden"><div class="flex gap-4"><div class="aspect-square h-16 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl"><img src="https://bookface-images.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/avatars/6d29997e5dca07682a88b7572c8bb04f