2 hover:opacity-80" href="/launches/PP3-voiceos-the-siri-for-productivity" target="_blank">See original launch post<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.293 14.707a1 1 0 010-1.414L10.586 10 7.293 6.707a1 1 0 011.414-1.414l4 4a1 1 0 010 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a></div><div class="launches-article-container prose max-w-full overflow-y-auto"><div><p>Launch video: <a href="https://youtu.be/QaVzPkH8JA0">https://youtu.be/QaVzPkH8JA0</a></p>
<div class="embed-container youtube relative pb-[56.25%] h-0">
      <iframe class="absolute t-0 l-0 w-full h-full border-[1px] border-color-[#ddd]" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/QaVzPkH8JA0" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </div>
<h2 id="the-problem-typing-sucks"><strong>The problem:</strong> Typing sucks</h2>
<p>Most people use their keyboard <strong>hundreds of times a day</strong> and the costs adds up:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Mental overhead</strong> turning thoughts into words</li>
<li>Spending time <strong>correcting</strong> <strong>your</strong> <strong>typos</strong></li>
<li><strong>Lost momentum</strong> when context-switching</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="/media/?type=post&amp;id=97653&amp;key=user_uploads%2F1521900%2F9d0e1af6-686c-4738-959b-17b2155c6d88&amp;variant=large" alt="uploaded image" /></p>
<h2 id="the-solution-voice-as-the-new-os"><strong>The solution:</strong> Voice as the new <strong>OS</strong></h2>
<p>VoiceOS is a universal voice interface that converts <strong>thoughts → polished output</strong> instantly.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Reply instantly:</strong> <em>“Ask to reschedule for tomorrow”</em> → replied instantly</li>
<li><strong>Better prompting:</strong> Turn thoughts into perfect prompts effortlessly</li>
<li><strong>Works everywhere:</strong> Works with any app with zero setup required</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="/media/?type=post&amp;id=97653&amp;key=user_uploads%2F1521900%2Ff3639813-a12c-4f6f-9c88-c61b7429ae76&amp;variant=large" alt="uploaded image" /></p>
<h2 id="the-team-voice-ai-pioneers"><strong>The team: Voice AI Pioneers</strong></h2>
<p>Kai, on the left, with Jonah on the right. Over the <strong>past 7 years</strong> they’ve built voice AI solutions, from consumer products to Fortune 500 deployments. They are now building a <strong>voice operating system</strong> built for a <strong>world where</strong> <strong>AGI</strong> is no longer science fiction but an emerging roadmap.</p>
<p><img src="/media/?type=post&amp;id=97653&amp;key=user_uploads%2F1521900%2F98299fdf-31e1-4bc5-b7ce-f9a6633ab874&amp;variant=large" alt="uploaded image" /></p>
<h2 id="our-ask"><strong>Our ask</strong></h2>
<p>Try it out for free! <a href="https://voiceos.com">https://voiceos.com</a></p>
<p>Use discount code <strong>YCLAUNCH</strong></p>
<p>— Kai &amp; Jonah</p>
